                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.526 Wines/27: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-17T12:00:00+00:00">February 17,
                        1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received February 17—8:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. Your telegram No. 10, February 15, 7 p.m. Informed by Foreign Office
                    instructions have been cabled Spanish Ambassador to close agreement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
